Never compromise these principles unless explicitly instructed:

1. Mobile responsiveness
2. SEO and digital marketing readiness
3. Code reuse and maintainability
4. Media optimization
5. Premium visual quality
6. Security and secret protection
7. Accessibility
8. Performance
9. Production reliability
10. No unnecessary complexity
